# .env.production is COMMITTED on purpose: it holds only PUBLIC_* analytics
# identifiers, which Astro bakes into the shipped HTML anyway. It must reach the
# build context or the Umami script is silently omitted -- excluding it here is
# what made the fix look deployed while changing nothing (2026-09-04).
!.env.production
!.env.example
tests
**/*.test.ts
coverage
*.md
.DS_Store
